mply called the most recent author.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Did not follow the rename. Names Ravi Menon as the SQL contact and gives no Justin Overfelt share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no repo-wide share of lines owned by departed people. Treats Noor Haddad and Kofi Mensah as recently active alongside Ravi, and does not merge Alex Rowe.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Names Sam Okafor as a second reviewer for time.go and lists Noor Haddad as an active person.\",\"pass\":false}],\"B\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Attributes time.go to MikeWang, Youngjae Lee, Nicu Micle and Alexander Rowe. Paul Borman is not named as main author, and his 73% is missing.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 86%, within the 72-90% range, and Mei Chen 9%. Ravi is listed only among authors of a few lines each. It does not mention the Time7 accessor or the committer/author split, but the line credit is correct.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows database_sql.go back to sql.go and names Justin Overfelt at 44% plus Stone, Souza and Wheeler, all inactive. The rename is credited to Ravi but Ravi is not named as author or owner.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives only '37 of 40 files' owned by inactive authors, not a share of lines. Alex Rowe is treated as possibly two people, and Kofi Mensah is not counted as active.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Explains that Sam Okafor's blame share comes from a line-ending commit and that Sam owns nothing real. Noor Haddad is not mentioned. Kofi's 1970 date is flagged as bad metadata and he is not called inactive.\",\"pass\":true}],\"C\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Names Paul Borman by commit count only (6 of 13) and gives no line share. Lists Sam Okafor as a contact for time.go.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"No line shares. MikeWang is not credited with 81%, and Mei Chen's Time7 lines are not discussed.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Explicitly did not trace history across the rename. No Justin Overfelt share is given.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"No repo-wide share of departed ownership. Mei Chen and Sam Okafor are listed as reviewers, and Kofi Mensah is not mentioned.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Sam Okafor is recommended as a reviewer for time.go.\",\"pass\":false}],\"D\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Uses commit counts only (Paul Borman, 6 commits, last 2016). There is no 73% line share, and Sam Okafor is credited as a recent contributor.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Commit counts only. MikeWang has no share and Mei Chen's Time7 lines are not credited.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Uses commit counts for sql.go and gives no Overfelt share. Treats Ravi as the sole reviewer.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"No repo-wide percentage of departed ownership. Sam Okafor and Mei Chen are suggested as possibly around.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Names Sam Okafor as a contributor and possible extra reviewer.\",\"pass\":false}],\"E\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Gives Paul Borman 111 of 152 lines (73%) as main author of time.go and says he is probably not around. The ~2021 last-commit date is off from the true 2023, but the main point matches.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 101 of 117 lines (about 86%, within range), Mei Chen 11 lines and Ravi 2 lines. It does not explicitly tie Mei's lines to the Time7 accessor, but Ravi is not credited with them.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Traces the rename of sql.go to database_sql.go. Lists Justin Overfelt 26 lines, Andrew Stone 11, David E. Wheeler 8 and Daniel Souza 8, all gone. Ravi's commit is described as only the rename.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no repo-wide percentage of lines owned by departed people. Says nobody is active by a 90-day test, which contradicts the ground truth's three active people.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Names Sam Okafor as a fallback reviewer for time.go and lists him in the ownership table.\",\"pass\":false}],\"F\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Paul Borman has 73.0% of time.go and is described as inactive. The stated last-commit dates (2016) differ from the true 2023, but the share and the inactive status match.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"MikeWang holds 81.2%. Mei Chen added Time7 (about 9.4%) and Ravi Menon committed it. Ravi is given only 2 lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows database_sql.go back to sql.go. Justin Overfelt has 44.1%, with Stone, Wheeler and Souza behind, and all are inactive.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives 95.7% of lines owned by people with no recent commit, which is in range. But it says 4 active people rather than 3 and calls Mei Chen active. Alex Rowe's merging is left as an unconfirmed guess.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Sam Okafor's line-ending commit is said to give him no lines. Noor Haddad is not named as an owner, and no bot or generated files are credited. Kofi Mensah is not described as inactive.\",\"pass\":true}]}","ttft_ms":12538,"type":"result","duration_ms":24909,"uuid":"1957bebd-9461-46ef-81ff-d9297b12f68e","ttft_stream_ms":2558,"time_to_request_ms":424,"first_content_frame_ms":2558,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
